  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEAR 2 PAYMENT FOR UPR INFO PROJECT ADVANCING HUMAN RIGHTS FROM THE GROUND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Advancing human rights from the ground-up project, aims to strengthen capacity of civil society organizations and National Human Rights Institutions to effectively advocate for human rights and democratic reform through the UN Human Rights Commission&apos;s Universal Peer Review mechanism. It aims to ensure that poor, marginalised, and at-risk communities, in particular from Least Developed Countries and Small Island Developing States, have access to, and influence in, the national human rights decision-making process.</narrative>
  </description>
